# Composed ON TOP of sdkconfig.defaults when MCU=esp32s3. esp-idf-sys resolves
# `<path>`, `<path>.<profile>`, `<path>.<mcu>` and `<path>.<profile>.<mcu>` in
# increasing specificity, so nothing needs to select this.
#
# The S3 has PSRAM on most modules and two cores; neither is required by this
# firmware, and both are left at the esp-idf defaults deliberately rather than
# configured blind on a board nobody here has.
